從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301529342152704257631.jpeg/uWzeclzBpORE2fLc0f5TPmlewj7PEfC4scM0BLHDNAQ\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301531414269952398072.jpeg/PkSF1fiZ-jjSKLgsNTAwuPOYDBz0rpLzg0Ova4NDr2s\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301533582856192305649.jpeg/Jxd25kKuf0nuy-mxmXJVNL0P_5lVWfPvKYcFYimHBWI\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301536070209536839046.jpeg/35IIpu6JrYvmg9uZdQ6HHWdvz4lcZfmmV9pNl1faTZc\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301513444954112812460.jpeg/Zcdga6ayD_PXBtZOza_-74AbvBetlT-TkraIwZK2iME\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301515902947328235407.jpeg/443bWQmce1V5btncbXpR5q97XRQT3lcHOqSFfzqkhX8\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231226/816301517920538624978465.jpeg/L8cQBwj0OUk8yzt_LpjJVpp3lQg_LlPZhERlLYREZS0\"/><figcaption>同事有多敬業？從敬業度分辨6種同事！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「經理人」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T01:39:58.308827+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2074,"images":35,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}